OL,3,A'Massive challenge' to protect
OL,4,ADonaldson from harm in jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtecting convicted paedophile Jeffrey
OL,7,FDonaldson from harm inside jail will be
OL,8,Fa "massive risk-management headache"
OL,9,Ffor prison bosses, according to a
OL,10,Fformer governor.
OL,12,FThe ex-Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,13,Fleader was given a 15-year sentence on
OL,14,FThursday after being convicted of 18
OL,15,Fcounts of sex abuse, including rape,
OL,16,Fagainst two women when they were
OL,17,Fchildren.
OL,19,FHe is serving his sentence at
OL,20,FMaghaberry Prison near Lisburn but will
OL,21,Fspend only half of his term behind
OL,22,Fbars.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
